    (" Ausnahme: Abbildungen mit Daten der Global Macro Database stehen samt Download unter <a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/deed.en\" rel=\"license\">CC BY-NC-SA 4.0</a>, weil die Datenbank diese Lizenz verlangt.",
     " Exception: charts using data from the Global Macro Database, including their downloads, are licensed under <a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/\" rel=\"license\">CC BY-NC-SA 4.0</a>, as the database requires."),
